        <div class="product-summary">
          <h1>ST101A Desktop Ionizing Air Blower</h1>
          <p class="product-short-desc">A desktop blower for a single operator position — an inspection bench, a rework station, a microscope. At 90 × 170 × 260 mm and 3.3 kg it stands beside the work rather than over it, and airflow adjusts from 45 to 110 CFM so it can be turned down to something an operator will leave switched on.</p>

          <div class="product-actions">
            <button class="quote-btn" type="button">Get a Quote</button>
            <a href="https://wa.me/61436605126" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="whatsapp-btn">WhatsApp</a>
          </div>

          <dl class="key-specs">
            <div><dt>Air coverage</dt><dd><strong>40 × 60 cm</strong></dd></div>
            <div><dt>Airflow</dt><dd><strong>45–110 CFM</strong>, adjustable</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Ion balance</dt><dd><strong>0 V ±10 V</strong></dd></div>
            <div><dt>Size / weight</dt><dd><strong>90 × 170 × 260 mm</strong> · 3.3 kg</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Supply</dt><dd>110 V/60 Hz or 220 V/50 Hz</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <p class="key-specs-note">Sized for one position. For a two-operator bench see the ST104A; for a full line, the ST1200.</p>
        </div>
